+# Separate follow-on adoption reviews
+
+Finder and skeptic independently accept the f77 adoption without findings. Neither used Lean, a server, builds or edits.
+
+Both verified exact adoption merge parents/retained ancestry, original three-path worker scope relative to f77, shared roots/config equal to upstream and unchanged protected constructor inputs/Source/Scoped/four helper proofs. Fresh acceptance uses13 passing worker checks, including owned build, kernel/MCP diagnostics,28 exact guards/explicit inventories, runtime and compiler controls.
+
+Both independently verified all12 current owned cache artifacts and four mappings match the retained H41 archive with unchanged SHA083d6bf7. No global cache freshness, dependency-closure transfer or recipient-import claim is made. New API descriptions retain relative dependencies, target-only uniqueness and existing-formula havoc limits; no new Source adequacy or duplicate producer is claimed.
+
+Root registration and global pin registry remain actual exit1 coordinator checks. Delivery/full validation remain coordinator-pending/pending coordinator merge. No shipping, withheld-owner repair or whole-lane completion is claimed. No remaining defects.
